{"title": "【Ace顶尖实习生】面向多语言的AI搜索检索和生成系统研究", "title_raw": "【Ace顶尖实习生】面向多语言的AI搜索检索和生成系统研究", "location": ["北京市，上海市，杭州市"], "location_raw": "北京市，上海市，杭州市", "education": "", "experience": "", "salary_range": null, "salary_raw": "", "skills": [], "responsibilities": "本课题的研究目标是打造行业领先的多语言能力强化的大语言模型，结合业务海量的多语言互译语料，以及平台生活化特色的笔记评论数据，利用数据合成、RL冷启训练、SFT和RLHF等技术，实现：\n1、在小红书多语言大模型翻译场景取得领先效果；\n2、多语言场景下，AI搜索的检索和生成技术。", "description_html": "", "job_type": "intern", "category": "unknown", "ai_relevance": "unknown", "ai_keywords": [], "source_url": "https://job.xiaohongshu.com/campus/position?keywords=AI", "post_date": "2026-07-17", "_raw_keys": ["positionId", "positionName", "amountInNeed", "workplaceIds", "workplace", "publishTime", "recruitStatus", "duty", "qualification", "jobType", "jobProjectName", "labels"], "id": "498e06a4a6779553", "company": "小红书", "company_id": "xiaohongshu", "company_category": "big_tech", "source_platform": "browser_api", "source_type": "official", "scraped_at": "2026-07-17T11:21:27.942883+08:00"}
{"title": "【Ace顶尖实习生】基于Agent框架的AI搜索基座大模型", "title_raw": "【Ace顶尖实习生】基于Agent框架的AI搜索基座大模型", "location": ["北京市，杭州市，上海市"], "location_raw": "北京市，杭州市，上海市", "education": "", "experience": "", "salary_range": null, "salary_raw": "", "skills": [], "responsibilities": "传统的AI搜索依然基于RAG框架，少有的几个Agent框架也只涉及QueryPlanning，距离真实解决搜索中的实际问题还相距很远，例如做旅游攻略、做行业研究报告等等。我们判断，虽然当下LLM已经大范围的用于搜索领域，但是下一代的搜索技术变革一定是基于Agent的。本课题旨在研究基于Agent框架的基座模型。", "description_html": "", "job_type": "intern", "category": "unknown", "ai_relevance": "unknown", "ai_keywords": [], "source_url": "https://job.xiaohongshu.com/campus/position?keywords=AI", "post_date": "2026-07-17", "_raw_keys": ["positionId", "positionName", "amountInNeed", "workplaceIds", "workplace", "publishTime", "recruitStatus", "duty", "qualification", "jobType", "jobProjectName", "labels"], "id": "68ce438395531f79", "company": "小红书", "company_id": "xiaohongshu", "company_category": "big_tech", "source_platform": "browser_api", "source_type": "official", "scraped_at": "2026-07-17T11:21:28.058600+08:00"}
